OL,3,GNEWSAMan who drugged and raped wife
OL,4,Awith strangers 'led double life'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This article contains
OL,7,Fdistressing content
OL,9,FA woman who believed she had not had
OL,10,Fsex for nine years had in fact been
OL,11,Fregularly drugged and raped by her own
OL,12,Fhusband and a group of strangers "whose
OL,13,Fdepravity knew no bounds", a jury has
OL,14,Fbeen told.
OL,16,FHer husband led a "double life",
OL,17,Fprosecutors said, regularly giving his
OL,18,Fwife a "stupefying cocktail" of drugs
OL,19,Fto make her "completely unaware" of the
OL,20,Fabuse.
